nce":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o059b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ad4084dfd65b559ba1b5","layer":"original","quote":"尚闻太祖北，释平原，还邺。其将吕旷、吕翔叛尚，归太祖；谭复阴刻将军印假旷、翔〖6〗。太祖知谭诈，与结婚以安之〖7〗；乃引军还。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o059","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ad4084dfd65b559ba1b5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖南征荆州。军至西平，谭、尚遂举兵相攻，谭败奔平原。尚攻之急，谭遣辛毗，诣太祖请救。太祖乃还救谭，十月至黎阳。﹝三﹞尚闻太祖北，释平原，还邺。其将吕旷、吕翔叛尚，归太祖；谭复阴刻将军印假旷、翔〖6〗。太祖知谭诈，与结婚以安之〖7〗；乃引军还。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o091b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d36d066801c8ec76926c","layer":"original","quote":"东平吕旷、吕翔叛尚，屯阳平〖9〗；率其众降，封为列侯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":481,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-09a0cf6c0d76993997e0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o088","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b55e52dce3d59a3bbee9","layer":"original","quote":"八年春三月〖2〗，攻其郭〖3〗；乃出战。击，大破之，谭、尚夜遁。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":477,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o091","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d36d066801c8ec76926c","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，到黎阳，为子整与谭结婚〖8〗。﹝二﹞尚闻公北，乃释平原，还邺。东平吕旷、吕翔叛尚，屯阳平〖9〗；率其众降，封为列侯。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":491,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
